21,Pua Kumbu Tapestries,"The pua kumbu or 'cover cloth' is traditionally woven by Iban ladies to manifest their dreams. Very few in the community attain the status of master weaver, who is able to interpret dreams, weave patterns to represent their dreams and to tell the stories or julok of pua fabric.","weaving, textile, arts",Arts & Crafts,"Tanoti House, Kuching, Sarawak",Sarawak,450.0,5000.0,9:00 AM - 5:30 PM,Daily,Not mentioned,4.3,HO15,Tanoti,082-239 277,https://tanoticrafts.com/collections/pua-kumbu-tapestries?srsltid=AfmBOorJ9f0Yj7FnzGgGNUl_Qe_y9gf5BG7ZakiGsiaNi--e0TJll2WL,09:00:00,17:30:00,Paid,pua kumbu cover cloth traditionally woven iban lady manifest dream community attain status master weaver able interpret dream weave pattern represent dream tell story julok pua fabric,weaving textile art,art craft,pua kumbu cover cloth traditionally woven iban lady manifest dream community attain status master weaver able interpret dream weave pattern represent dream tell story julok pua fabric weaving textile art weaving textile art weaving textile art art craft art craft ,"Pua Kumbu Tapestries The pua kumbu or 'cover cloth' is traditionally woven by Iban ladies to manifest their dreams. Very few in the community attain the status of master weaver, who is able to interpret dreams, weave patterns to represent their dreams and to tell the stories or julok of pua fabric. weaving, textile, artsweaving, textile, artsweaving, textile, arts"
